  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">• Brand introduction:&nbsp;</p><div style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.6px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" id=\"isPasted\"><span style=\"color: rgb(124, 112, 107);\">Welcome to Bolidi Collectors Cars!</span></div><div style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.6px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(124, 112, 107);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"></span></div><div style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.6px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(124, 112, 107);\">My name is Riccardo, an Italian car enthusiast with a lifelong love for all things with wheels and like many of you, my passion for cars began when I was just a kid.</span></div><div style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.6px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(124, 112, 107);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"></span></div><div style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.6px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(124, 112, 107);\">Growing up, I was obsessed with collecting diecast car models. I can still count the hours spent playing with friends, imagining epic races and building my dream garage. I even created a little “Motorsport newspaper,” cutting out pictures of supercars from magazines and arranging them into my own fantasy collection.</span></div><div style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.6px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(124, 112, 107);\">As time passed, that love for cars took a backseat. Sports, university, work were on my priority list.</span></div><div style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.6px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(124, 112, 107);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"></span></div><div style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.6px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(124, 112, 107);\">But in 2022, something changed!&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.6px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(124, 112, 107);\">The birth of my first son reignited that old passion for cars. We began spending hours together hunting for toy cars in stores, drawing our favorites and bonding over our shared passion. And that’s when it hit me — <strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">why not share this joy with other car lovers?</strong></span></div><div style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.6px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(124, 112, 107);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"></span></div><div style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.6px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(124, 112, 107);\">That’s how Bolidi Collectors Cars is born in July 2024 as a simple side hustle project inspired by those childhood memories.</span></div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br>• Product description:</span></p><div style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.6px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" id=\"isPasted\"><span style=\"color: rgb(124, 112, 107);\">Bolidi's mission is to bring car enthusiasts an easy and stylish way to showcase their love for iconic cars. Our enamel pins are designed to let you express your passion in everyday life whether you pin them on your jacket, bag, backpack, or anywhere else that needs a touch of automotive coolness. We also propose a clothing collection of curated t-shirts both embroidered and printed to give cars enthusiasts the possibility to wear their passion with style.&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.6px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br>• USP (Unique Selling Point):</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(124, 112, 107);\">At Bolidi, it’s all about celebrating the timeless designs of classic cars and turning them into wearable art for all enthusiasts. So whether you’re reliving your childhood memories or starting your own collection, we are here to make sure your love for cars stays front and center</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br>• Payment terms:</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(124, 112, 107);\">Monthly via Paypal.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br>• Other information:&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(124, 112, 107);\">We do accept affiliates request only from Europe.&nbsp;</span></p></div>",
